            "filename": "frames_starlightguardians_nu/frame0065424.jpg",
            "overlay_texts": [
                "VORTEX STATION — SKYFORGE DOCKING BAY",
                "A cathedral of salvage and secrecy, where Magnetica holds its breath.",
                "Arc welders slay the dark in silence — each flash a small ordeal, repaid in shadow.",
                "Beneath the ore hauler, one figure drifts. Tenuously connected. Cerebrally alone."
            ],
