            "filename": "frames_starlightguardians_nu/frame0057176.jpg",
            "overlay_texts": [
                "Vortex Station. Outer Ring. Oxygen Credits: Critical.",
                "The numbers on Winn&#039;s forearm say suffocation. Kael says optimal.",
                "Three hundred sleepers below — dreamless, frozen, favorably reported.",
                "Somewhere in the deep void, something docks. Neither of them asks what."
            ],
            "fuki_texts": []
